# OpenCoder (OpenCode) — optional

## In the repo

- **Agent prompt:** `.opencode/agents/opencoder.md` — use in the **OpenCode** TUI with **`@opencoder`** if you use OpenCode locally.
- **`opencode.json`:** schema marker only.

## For Cursor agents

**Default second-brain via API:** use **`node scripts/openrouter-ask.mjs`** with **`OPENROUTER_API_KEY`** (see **`blockminer-openrouter-second-brain.mdc`**). OpenCode is **not** required for that.

For planning style only (no API call), you may still **read** `.opencode/agents/opencoder.md` (§ BlockMiner project brain) and mirror its structure.
